WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Select Figure 8 in the outline and see the original alongside the reading.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Open panel A, click the horizontal axis and follow the line to its explanation.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Collect A and B in the slide basket, add notes and drag them into order.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Open the mind map. Current figure brings the branch for the figure beside it into view.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Open Slides and edit the text on the slide. Speaker notes have a separate field.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Rehearse, reveal the notes when needed, then export the complete PowerPoint.
